## AgySafe delegation

If the user explicitly asks to use AgySafe, AGY, or Antigravity, run:

```text
agysafe --workspace "." --json "<exact user task>"
```

Model and mode are automatic by default. If the user specifies a model, pass `--model <slug>`.

Do not bypass AgySafe isolation and do not repeatedly retry failed long tasks.
<!-- AGYSAFE:END -->
